      "text": "JUST LOOK AT WHAT ASTRA CAN DO🤯🔥\n\nI gave GPT-6 Astra an image and a prompt - and it built an interactive 3D scene! The knight adds firewood, practices sword fighting, roasts meat, and sleeps\n\nEverything runs in your browser, in a single HTML file\n\nI gave Fable 5.1 the same prompt and image - but in my attempt, it couldn't pull it off",
